{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "root": {
    "type": "Grid",
    "props": {
      "columns": 12,
      "gap": 16
    },
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "summary",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "variant": "hero"
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "summary"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "KPIStrip",
            "id": "summary_kpistrip",
            "props": {
              "items": [
                {
                  "label": "Font uses",
                  "field": "uses",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Objects",
                  "field": "objects",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Layouts",
                  "field": "layouts",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Uncertain",
                  "field": "uncertain",
                  "format": "number"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "filter_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "summary"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Row",
            "id": "filter_row",
            "props": {
              "gap": 12,
              "align": "center"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextInput",
                "id": "search_input",
                "props": {
                  "param": "search",
                  "placeholder": "Search font, layout, object or field…",
                  "width": 30,
                  "resetParams": [
                    "objects_page"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "Select",
                "id": "file_select",
                "data": {
                  "dataset": "file_options"
                },
                "props": {
                  "param": "file",
                  "label": "File",
                  "emptyOptionLabel": "All files",
                  "multiple": true,
                  "resetParams": [
                    "objects_page"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "Select",
                "id": "theme_select",
                "data": {
                  "dataset": "theme_options"
                },
                "props": {
                  "param": "theme",
                  "label": "Theme",
                  "emptyOptionLabel": "All themes",
                  "multiple": true,
                  "separator": "|",
                  "resetParams": [
                    "objects_page"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "Select",
                "id": "layout_select",
                "data": {
                  "dataset": "layout_options"
                },
                "props": {
                  "param": "layout_uuid",
                  "label": "Layout",
                  "emptyOptionLabel": "All layouts",
                  "resetParams": [
                    "layout_file",
                    "objects_page"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "Select",
                "id": "font_select",
                "data": {
                  "dataset": "font_options"
                },
                "props": {
                  "param": "font",
                  "label": "Font",
                  "emptyOptionLabel": "All fonts",
                  "multiple": true,
                  "separator": "|",
                  "resetParams": [
                    "objects_page"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "Select",
                "id": "size_select",
                "data": {
                  "dataset": "size_options"
                },
                "props": {
                  "param": "size",
                  "label": "Size",
                  "emptyOptionLabel": "All sizes",
                  "multiple": true,
                  "separator": "|",
                  "resetParams": [
                    "objects_page"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "FilterChips",
            "id": "source_chips",
            "props": {
              "param": "source",
              "default": "",
              "resetParams": [
                "objects_page"
              ],
              "options": [
                {
                  "value": "",
                  "label": "With a font name",
                  "countField": "chip_src_named"
                },
                {
                  "value": "local",
                  "label": "Local",
                  "countField": "chip_src_local"
                },
                {
                  "value": "local_redundant",
                  "label": "Local, same as inherited",
                  "countField": "chip_src_local_redundant"
                },
                {
                  "value": "style",
                  "label": "Style",
                  "countField": "chip_src_style"
                },
                {
                  "value": "theme",
                  "label": "Theme",
                  "countField": "chip_src_theme"
                },
                {
                  "value": "rich_text",
                  "label": "Rich text",
                  "countField": "chip_src_rich_text"
                },
                {
                  "value": "chart",
                  "label": "Chart",
                  "countField": "chip_src_chart"
                },
                {
                  "value": "default",
                  "label": "File default",
                  "countField": "chip_src_default"
                },
                {
                  "value": "all",
                  "label": "All sources",
                  "countField": "chip_src_all"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "FilterChips",
            "id": "face_chips",
            "props": {
              "param": "face",
              "default": "",
              "resetParams": [
                "objects_page"
              ],
              "options": [
                {
                  "value": "",
                  "label": "All faces",
                  "countField": "chip_face_all"
                },
                {
                  "value": "normal",
                  "label": "Regular",
                  "countField": "chip_face_normal"
                },
                {
                  "value": "bold",
                  "label": "Bold",
                  "countField": "chip_face_bold"
                },
                {
                  "value": "italic",
                  "label": "Italic",
                  "countField": "chip_face_italic"
                },
                {
                  "value": "bold italic",
                  "label": "Bold italic",
                  "countField": "chip_face_bold_italic"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "FilterChips",
            "id": "otype_chips",
            "props": {
              "param": "otype",
              "default": "",
              "resetParams": [
                "objects_page"
              ],
              "options": [
                {
                  "value": "",
                  "label": "All",
                  "countField": "chip_all"
                },
                {
                  "value": "text",
                  "label": "Text",
                  "countField": "chip_text"
                },
                {
                  "value": "field",
                  "label": "Field",
                  "countField": "chip_field"
                },
                {
                  "value": "dropdown",
                  "label": "Drop-down list",
                  "countField": "chip_dropdown"
                },
                {
                  "value": "popup",
                  "label": "Pop-up menu",
                  "countField": "chip_popup"
                },
                {
                  "value": "checkbox",
                  "label": "Checkbox set",
                  "countField": "chip_checkbox"
                },
                {
                  "value": "radio",
                  "label": "Radio buttons",
                  "countField": "chip_radio"
                },
                {
                  "value": "calendar",
                  "label": "Calendar",
                  "countField": "chip_calendar"
                },
                {
                  "value": "button",
                  "label": "Button",
                  "countField": "chip_button"
                },
                {
                  "value": "tab",
                  "label": "Tab control",
                  "countField": "chip_tab"
                },
                {
                  "value": "chart",
                  "label": "Chart",
                  "countField": "chip_chart"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "objects_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Objects and their fonts",
          "keepChildrenOnEmpty": true
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "objects"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "objects_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "row_key",
              "density": "compact",
              "sortable": true,
              "searchable": false,
              "pageParam": "objects_page",
              "sortParam": "objects_sort",
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "file_name",
                  "label": "File",
                  "breakAt": "separators"
                },
                {
                  "field": "layout_name",
                  "label": "Layout",
                  "breakAt": "separators"
                },
                {
                  "field": "object_type",
                  "label": "Type",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "object",
                  "label": "Object",
                  "breakAt": "separators"
                },
                {
                  "field": "font",
                  "label": "Font",
                  "valueLabels": {
                    "#default": "— file default"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "field": "size",
                  "label": "Size",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "face",
                  "label": "Face",
                  "nowrap": true,
                  "valueLabels": {
                    "normal": "regular",
                    "bold": "bold",
                    "italic": "italic",
                    "bold italic": "bold italic"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "field": "source",
                  "label": "Source",
                  "format": "badge",
                  "nowrap": true,
                  "valueLabels": {
                    "local": "local",
                    "local_redundant": "local, same as inherited",
                    "style": "style",
                    "theme": "theme",
                    "default": "file default",
                    "rich_text": "rich text",
                    "chart": "chart"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "field": "style",
                  "label": "Style"
                },
                {
                  "field": "detail",
                  "label": "Run / area",
                  "valueLabels": {
                    "title": "chart title",
                    "legend": "legend",
                    "x_axis_title": "x-axis title",
                    "x_axis_label": "x-axis labels",
                    "y_axis_title": "y-axis title",
                    "y_axis_label": "y-axis labels",
                    "data_label": "data labels"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "field": "low_confidence",
                  "label": "Uncertain",
                  "valueLabels": {
                    "true": "yes",
                    "false": ""
                  }
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openObject",
                "args": {
                  "uuid": "{{nav_uuid}}",
                  "ref": "{{_layout_uuid}}",
                  "file": "{{file_name}}"
                }
              },
              "rowAction": {
                "action": "openObject",
                "args": {
                  "uuid": "{{_layout_uuid}}",
                  "type": "Layout",
                  "file": "{{file_name}}",
                  "ref": "{{nav_uuid}}"
                }
              },
              "rowActionLabel": "Show in layout",
              "empty": {
                "message": "No font use in this selection."
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "notes_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Where a font comes from",
          "collapsible": true
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Markdown",
            "id": "notes_md",
            "props": {
              "content": "**Source of the base font.** FileMaker takes the first value that is set:\n- *local* — set on the object itself.\n- *local, same as inherited* — set on the object, but the same font it would get anyway. FileMaker writes it when *bold* is applied to a font with its own bold face; it is no deliberate choice.\n- *style* — the style applied to the object. A style holds only what it changes; everything else comes from the theme.\n- *theme* — the theme's default for the object type, for the layout part or for all fields.\n- *file default* — the theme names no font at all (Classic, Minimalist). FileMaker then uses a default of the file, which the XML export does not contain — the same theme shows Helvetica Neue in one file and Arial in another. The list therefore names no font for these objects; check one object per file in FileMaker.\n\n**Further font uses.** *Rich text* is a part of a text formatted with the text cursor; it adds to the base font of the object, the rest of the text keeps it. *Chart* is the font of a chart text area (title, legend, axes, data labels); series titles are left out, they keep the theme font.\n\n**Counting.** *Fonts* groups spellings of one font (`arial`, `Arial`). The file default is no font: it counts in neither the number of fonts nor *many fonts*. *Uncertain*: the value comes from a layout-part rule (rank not verified), or the applied style no longer exists in the theme.\n\n**Limits.** Fonts of conditional formatting are not listed. A font name says nothing about whether the font is installed on the clients."
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
